    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Magical World of Glaurune!\u00a0</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Glaurune?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glaurune is a fast-paced Action-RPG where you play as Wizard, Warrior or Rogue in various PvP and PvE game modes. Currently the development focus lies mainly on PvP and smaller PvE experiences. More extensive PvE modes are planned for the future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595280/extras/cfe2e37fe4d5143932e306a0e9b15f64.poster.avif?t=1754111496\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595280/extras/cfe2e37fe4d5143932e306a0e9b15f64.webm?t=1754111496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595280/extras/cfe2e37fe4d5143932e306a0e9b15f64.mp4?t=1754111496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-paced PvP-action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your play style in Glaurune's multiplayer! Grab a greatsword or fireball staff for intense hack and slash action. For those who prefer a more devious approach, dive into mastering stealth, traps and crafting unique spell combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge real opponents online or sharpen your skills offline against AI in the Arena or Capture the Flag (CTF). Join the action on official GlauNet servers or take control and host your own custom games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595280/extras/c96c309be2e234e0357014c172930196.poster.avif?t=1754111496\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595280/extras/c96c309be2e234e0357014c172930196.webp?t=1754111496\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=256 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Class Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your character with a flexible attribute system that lets you customize your class to fit your playstyle. With no rigid class restrictions, you can mix and match skills from a vast pool to create your ideal hero. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your hero truly your own with Glaurune's Character Editor, where you can tweak appearance and equipment to suit your style. Personalize your character with a wide variety of hairstyles, accessories, emotes and full color customization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In-game Level Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon your creativity with the in-game editor, allowing you to craft custom arenas, design unique challenges, or brew up your own magical mischief. Share your creations with your fellow adventurers across the realms of GlauNet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Magical World of Glaurune!\u00a0</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Glaurune?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glaurune is a fast-paced Action-RPG where you play as Wizard, Warrior or Rogue in various PvP and PvE game modes. Currently the development focus lies mainly on PvP and smaller PvE experiences. More extensive PvE modes are planned for the future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595280/extras/cfe2e37fe4d5143932e306a0e9b15f64.poster.avif?t=1754111496\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595280/extras/cfe2e37fe4d5143932e306a0e9b15f64.webm?t=1754111496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595280/extras/cfe2e37fe4d5143932e306a0e9b15f64.mp4?t=1754111496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-paced PvP-action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your play style in Glaurune's multiplayer! Grab a greatsword or fireball staff for intense hack and slash action. For those who prefer a more devious approach, dive into mastering stealth, traps and crafting unique spell combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge real opponents online or sharpen your skills offline against AI in the Arena or Capture the Flag (CTF). Join the action on official GlauNet servers or take control and host your own custom games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595280/extras/c96c309be2e234e0357014c172930196.poster.avif?t=1754111496\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595280/extras/c96c309be2e234e0357014c172930196.webp?t=1754111496\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=256 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Class Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your character with a flexible attribute system that lets you customize your class to fit your playstyle. With no rigid class restrictions, you can mix and match skills from a vast pool to create your ideal hero. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your hero truly your own with Glaurune's Character Editor, where you can tweak appearance and equipment to suit your style. Personalize your character with a wide variety of hairstyles, accessories, emotes and full color customization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In-game Level Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon your creativity with the in-game editor, allowing you to craft custom arenas, design unique challenges, or brew up your own magical mischief. Share your creations with your fellow adventurers across the realms of GlauNet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "short_description": "Sling spells, swing steel in a highly physics-driven, fast-paced and interactive environment. The intense combo and counter gameplay rewards quick thinking and creative usage of skills. Countless spell combinations are waiting to be discovered.",
